1
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:10,920
My thought is

2
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,340
to go for it,

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,280
and go big.

4
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,560
I want to invite more friends over.

5
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,640
After the ceremony,

6
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,520
we can throw

7
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:20,320
a huge party.

8
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:23,580
It'll be great for everyone
to drink and have fun together.

9
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:24,320
Right.

10
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,720
I've already checked with them.

11
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,160
They'll fly back from abroad.

12
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,200
We just need

13
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,610
to set aside time
in advance to arrange it.

14
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:33,940
Then everything is

15
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,920
all set.

16
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,320
Leave the rest

17
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:39,600
to me.

18
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:40,680
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

19
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,440
Thanks, Dad.

20
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:42,920
Nanny.

21
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,400
Get the car ready.

22
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,080
Okay.

23
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,330
You two keep eating.

24
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,080
I'll walk you out.

25
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:55,680
Dad,

26
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,420
it's raining outside.

27
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,400
How about you don't visit Mom today.

28
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,890
Go tomorrow morning when it clears up.

29
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:08,600
Rain or shine.

30
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:09,970
A little rain

31
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:11,440
is nothing.

32
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,240
Yanyan

33
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,780
is looking out for her dad.

34
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,700
She's grown up.

35
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,620
What are you doing?

36
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,160
I'm not doing anything.

37
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:46,800
I just wanted to...

38
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:47,660
Wanted to what?

39
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,300
Don't even think about it.

40
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,840
Go back to your own house.

41
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,479
Auntie Wu, see him out.

42
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:05,420
The old man goes to
the old residence on time.

43
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:16,160
The closely watched Typhoon Megi

44
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:18,680
swept across Luzon Island
in the Philippines a week ago.

45
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,880
...and is heading straight
for our Motor City.

46
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,840
Although it has weakened significantly,

47
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,040
it will still bring heavy wind and rain.

48
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:25,960
Zhao,

49
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,140
turn it off.

50
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,050
Yes, Mr. Gao.

51
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,480
Mr. Gao, maybe

52
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,720
we shouldn't go.

53
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,320
The radio said

54
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,760
there's extreme weather tonight,

55
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,290
a once-in-a-decade event.

56
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,180
It's been 30 years.

57
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,840
I've never missed it.

58
00:02:48,079 --> 00:02:50,160
How about I drop you off
when we get there?

59
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:50,880
No need.

60
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,200
I drew a box

61
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,360
and made a waterproof mark,

62
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,840
right next to that tree.

63
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,520
You just need to park the tricycle

64
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,200
inside that box.

65
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,480
Hello,

66
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,380
the vehicle is parked.

67
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,800
But this positioning box you drew,

68
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,280
won't it be discovered later?

69
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,010
Don't worry.

70
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,760
Someone will clean it up.

71
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,120
Find a quiet place to hide

72
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:00,250
and report to me at any time.

73
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:29,220
What's the situation on your end?

74
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,160
I guess

75
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,360
Gao Yuhai is almost there.

76
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,280
I've arrived,

77
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,520
but it seems a car has been following me.

78
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,450
Don't worry.

79
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:38,610
Take it easy.

80
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,560
I have my own arrangements for the rest.

81
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,970
Why does this car look so familiar?

82
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,300
It can't be.

83
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,480
Who would be so bored

84
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,440
to put it here?

85
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,320
No.

86
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:36,760
These dents,

87
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,880
this model...

88
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,300
Do you understand?

89
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,360
Can Shen Xi do it?

90
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,570
Will there be any mistakes?

91
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,690
Very likely.

92
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,440
If he doesn't die from the first hit,

93
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,280
you follow up

94
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:13,760
and hit him again.

95
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,460
Do you dare?

96
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,440
For Shen Xi,

97
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:24,680
I do.

98
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,450
That old bastard

99
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,940
is worse than a beast. He deserves to die.

100
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:34,600
What if he doesn't die

101
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,460
from the first hit?

102
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,360
Then we'll see

103
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,380
where he's injured first.

104
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,920
I've read a lot of books on this recently.

105
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,520
I should be able to handle it.

106
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,720
For bullying Shen Xi,

107
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,159
he must die.

108
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,000
He must die.

109
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,000
If everything goes smoothly

110
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,860
and Gao Yuhai is killed in one hit,

111
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:57,810
remember

112
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,520
the box I drew.

113
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,520
You're responsible for
cleaning up the scene.

114
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,250
Understand?

115
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,370
Understood.

116
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,840
Save me.

117
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,000
I remember now.

118
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:52,000
You're the one who gave me the toy.

119
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,330
Yes, I even took you
to the amusement park.

120
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,200
Xiao Si,

121
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,720
say hi to Uncle Gao.

122
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,480
Say it.

123
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:02,520
This is...

124
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,640
My son.

125
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,500
He's grown so tall.

126
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,960
A bit shy with strangers, too.

127
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,160
Shy, yes.

128
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:18,920
I just

129
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:20,040
checked,

130
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,200
and Jiuzhou's condition is stable.

131
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,980
He was rescued in time.

132
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:28,200
Let him get a good sleep.

133
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,360
Zhao Wenjuan.

134
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,000
I have other things
to attend to at the group,

135
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,330
so I'll head back first.

136
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,880
If you have any difficulties
in the future,

137
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:41,940
come to me anytime.

138
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,600
I'll walk you out.

139
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,520
That's right.

140
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,960
I am Bai Jiuzhou's son.

141
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,120
Bai Xiaosi!

142
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,440
He kidnapped me,

143
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:33,400
threatened my dad
to commit perjury for him,

144
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,060
and killed Song Yanfei's dad.

145
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,780
Then he sent Feng Shu
to stage a traffic accident

146
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,640
to kill my dad,

147
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,000
leaving no witnesses.

148
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,260
My dad was lucky

149
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:44,240
and survived.

150
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:47,120
He even went to the hospital
to finish him off.

151
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:47,760
Officer,

152
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:49,280
isn't he guilty of heinous crimes?

153
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:50,720
Doesn't he deserve it?

154
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,880
Doesn't he deserve to die?

155
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,880
You should seek legal help

156
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:57,240
instead of fighting
violence with violence.

157
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:59,040
Understand? You're still a kid.

158
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,600
Would that even work?

159
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:03,200
My mom stayed with him
for so many years despite her disgust.

160
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,240
Why?

161
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:06,040
Wasn't it just for the evidence?

162
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,130
He's rich and powerful.

163
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:10,240
What else could a widow and her child

164
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,800
do?

165
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,980
There's nothing we can do.

166
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:46,920
Mr. Feng,

167
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,200
Feng Shu!

168
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:03,960
You're finally

169
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:06,080
here.

170
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:12,920
The recent death of Gao Yuhai,
a prominent local entrepreneur,

171
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,560
in a car accident

172
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,720
has drawn much public attention.

173
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,160
No one expected

174
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,760
that such an accident would bring

175
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,760
so many old cases to light.

176
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:24,440
Even the suicide case of Song Yucheng,
chairman of Dacheng Group,

177
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,960
who was under criminal investigation

178
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:28,560
for illegal business operations
10 years ago,

179
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,440
has been reopened.

180
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,520
Facts have proven

181
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,120
that Song Yucheng was indeed framed

182
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:35,080
by Wending Group back then.

183
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,680
It makes one sigh

184
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,080
at the unpredictability

185
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,040
of life.

186
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,640
Truth may be late,

187
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:42,320
but it is never absent.

